Governance boundary statement

The BAS Test 0 simulation framework is a lightweight causal-pressure model for ranking sensitivities before construction. It may estimate where bounded 6-inch vertical cycling appears possible under assumptions. It may identify likely failure modes and measurement priorities. It may not validate BAS, prove stability, establish repeatability, support output or efficiency claims, or replace physical measurement. Simulated bounded behavior remains an analytical hypothesis until a physical run preserves synchronized evidence showing bounded behavior under recorded conditions.